   <text type="letter">
      <body>
         <div type="writingSession">
            <pb n="1"/>
            <opener><dateline><date when="1949-12-09">December 9, 1949</date></dateline><lb/>
               <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Dr. Paul Tillich</rs><lb/>
               Union Theological Seminary<lb/>
               Broadway at 120th Street<lb/>
               <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__319" type="place">New York 27, N.Y.</rs>
               <salute>Dear <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Dr.
                  Tillich</rs>:</salute>
            </opener>
            <p>The Book Review Committee of THEOLOGY TODAY has been of the opinion that we should 
            carry a long review upon the occasion of the reprinting of the <hi rend="underline">The Social Teaching
            of the Christian Churches, by <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1954" type="person">Ernst Troeltsch</rs></hi>.
            There would be no fixed length for the review, and hope was expressed that the work of
            <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1954" type="person">Troeltsch</rs> might be reappraised in the light
            of development since his day.</p>
            <p>May I ask whether you would be interested in undertaking this review at your own
               convenience?</p>
            <closer>
               <salute>Sincerely yours,</salute>
               <signed><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__656" type="person"
                  ><hi rend="hand">Kenneth S. Gapp</hi><lb/>Kenneth S. Gapp</rs><lb/>Book Review Editor</signed>
            KSG:gv</closer>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
